B.azV=s(["Terms of Use","These Terms and Conditions apply to the services made available on RenoResearch.SG and are in addition to the Website Terms of Use that apply from time to time. By using the Website and/or our services, you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions."],t.s)
B.aB6=s(["1. Definitions and Interpretation",'1.1. In these Terms and Conditions, the following words and expressions have the following meanings:\n\n"Customer" / "Homeowner" \u2013 an individual who uses the Website to search for and engage interior-design or renovation professionals;\n\n"Professional" / "Interior Designer" \u2013 a business or individual offering renovation or interior-design services on the Website;\n\n"Services" \u2013 the professional renovation / interior-design services provided by a Professional to a Customer;\n\n"Website" \u2013 RenoResearch.SG and any associated sub-domains;\n\n"us / we / Reno Research" \u2013 Reno Research Private Limited, UEN: 202404711N;\n\n"Facilitation Services" \u2013 the matchmaking and contact-facilitation services Reno Research provides between Customers and Professionals.\n\n1.2. Headings are for ease of reference only and do not affect interpretation.\n1.3. References to a "person" include individuals, companies, partnerships, organisations and similar entities.\n1.4. References to legislation include subordinate legislation and re-enactments.\n1.5. "Include" and similar words are to be read without limitation.\n1.6. References to "writing" include email.'],t.s)
B.aC3=s(["2. How Our Platform Works","2.1. Reno Research operates a platform that connects homeowners with vetted interior-design and renovation professionals.\n\n2.2. You may browse professional profiles, view portfolios, read reviews, and submit project enquiries at no charge.\n\n2.3. When you submit an enquiry, your contact details and project requirements may be shared with one or more Professionals so that they can reach out to you.\n\n2.4. Reno Research acts only as a facilitator. Any contract for renovation or interior-design Services is between you and the Professional directly. Reno Research is not a party to that contract and is not liable for the quality, timeliness, or outcome of those Services."],t.s)
B.aAJ=s(["3. Your Obligations as a Homeowner","3.1. You agree to provide accurate and truthful information when creating an account or submitting an enquiry.\n\n3.2. You will communicate respectfully and in good faith with Professionals.\n\n3.3. You are responsible for evaluating and selecting the Professional that best suits your needs. Reno Research does not guarantee the suitability of any Professional.\n\n3.4. You must comply with all applicable laws in connection with your use of the Website."],t.s)
B.azy=s(["4. Intellectual Property Rights","All intellectual property rights in materials, data or other information provided by Reno Research (including Website content, logos and trademarks) belong to Reno Research (subject to any third-party rights). You may not reproduce, distribute or create derivative works without prior written consent."],t.s)
B.aCB=s(["5. Disclaimers & Limitation of Liability",'5.1. The Website and Facilitation Services are provided on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis. Reno Research makes no warranties, express or implied, regarding the accuracy, reliability or completeness of information on the Website.\n\n5.2. Reno Research will not be liable for: (a) loss of profit, sales or business; (b) loss of goodwill, reputation or opportunity; (c) any liability you may owe to third parties; (d) loss of data; or (e) indirect or consequential loss.\n\n5.3. Nothing in these Terms excludes liability for death or personal injury resulting from negligence, fraud, or any liability that cannot be excluded by law.'],t.s)
B.aBz=s(["6. Data Protection","Please see our Privacy Policy and Cookie Policy for details on how personal information is collected, used, and protected."],t.s)
B.azs=s(["7. Termination","7.1. You may stop using the Website at any time.\n\n7.2. Reno Research reserves the right to suspend or terminate your account if you breach these Terms or engage in behaviour that is harmful to the platform, other users or Professionals.\n\n7.3. Upon termination, provisions relating to intellectual property, limitation of liability and governing law will survive."],t.s)
B.aBR=s(["8. General Provisions","8.1. These Terms are personal to you and you may not assign or transfer rights or obligations without Reno Research's written consent.\n\n8.2. If any provision is found invalid or unenforceable, the remainder will not be affected.\n\n8.3. These Terms and Conditions are governed by the laws of Singapore and the Singapore courts have exclusive jurisdiction."],t.s)
B.aCc=s(["Contact Us","If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us at hello@renoresearch.sg.\n\nReno Research Pte. Ltd.\nEmail: hello@renoresearch.sg\nEffective Date: 22 October 2025\nThese Terms were last updated on 22 October 2025."],t.s)
B.aB2=s([B.azV,B.aB6,B.aC3,B.aAJ,B.azy,B.aCB,B.aBz,B.azs,B.aBR,B.aCc],t.rj)
B.aBo=s(["Privacy Policy",'This Policy applies to the collection, use, and disclosure of an individual customer\'s Personal Data by Reno Research Pte Ltd and its affiliates (collectively "Reno Research").'],t.s)
B.aBs=s(["1. General",'This Policy outlines the obligations and practices of Reno Research regarding Personal Data.\nReno Research will use reasonable efforts to respect the confidentiality of Personal Data. By interacting with us, you consent to the collection, use, and disclosure of your Personal Data as described in this Policy.\nThis Policy supplements other consents you may have given regarding your Personal Data.\n"Personal Data" means data about an individual who can be identified from that data or from that data and other information Reno Research has access to.'],t.s)
B.aB5=s(["2. Statement of Practices","Personal Data collected may include: name, address, phone number, email, or any other details necessary to help service your enquiry.\n\nWe use cookies on our websites. You can set your browser to refuse cookies if you prefer."],t.s)
B.aCS=s(["3. Purpose of Collection","Personal Data is collected for matching to service providers, internal training, market research, direct contact, and informing you of new services.\n\nPersonal Data may be disclosed within Reno Research, and it may be disclosed to third parties such as regulators, law enforcement, lawyers, auditors, service providers, and potential buyers.\n\nPersonal Data may also be disclosed as required by law, for legal proceedings, to establish or defend legal rights, or with your consent."],t.s)
B.aD6=s(["4. Optional Data Provision","Additional data may be requested to improve services, but it is optional.\n\nCalls to service hotlines may be recorded for quality control and training purposes."],t.s)
B.aC0=s(["5. Requesting Data Deletion","You can request the deletion of your Personal Data.\nEmail your deletion requests to hello@renoresearch.sg. We will delete your data unless retention is legally required. If we cannot delete your data, we will inform you of the reasons.\n\nDeletion of data may affect our ability to provide services.\nRequests will be processed within thirty (30) days."],t.s)
B.aAT=s(["6. Transfer of Personal Data Overseas","Personal Data may be processed in jurisdictions outside Singapore. Reno Research will comply with the Personal Data Protection Act."],t.s)
B.azU=s(["7. Accuracy of Personal Data","Reno Research will use reasonable efforts to ensure data accuracy and will update data upon notification. We use safeguards to protect Personal Data but cannot guarantee absolute security."],t.s)
B.aBl=s(["8. Access and Correction of Personal Data","You have the right to:\na) Check if Reno Research holds your Personal Data and obtain copies.\nb) Request correction of inaccurate Personal Data.\n\nA reasonable fee may be charged for access requests.\nProof of identity may also be required for data access or correction."],t.s)
B.aDe=s(["9. Accessing and Deleting Personal Information","Singapore residents can request disclosure of collected personal information. You may also request the deletion of personal information. Requests should be sent via email to hello@renoresearch.sg.\n\nAdditional information may be required for identity verification.\nRetention of certain information may be necessary for legal, security, or business reasons."],t.s)
B.aAN=s(["10. Storage and Retention of Personal Data","Personal Data will be deleted or anonymized when no longer needed for business or legal purposes."],t.s)
B.aC8=s(["11. Contacting You","By providing contact information, you consent to being contacted for purposes stated in this Policy, even if your contact information is listed on the Do Not Call Registry."],t.s)
B.aBi=s(["12. Change Policy","Reno Research reserves the right to alter this Policy, should the need arise for business or legal purposes. If you do not agree to the changes, inform us as soon as possible."],t.s)
B.aAh=s(["13. Governing Law","This Policy is governed by the laws of Singapore, and disputes shall be subject to the jurisdiction of Singapore courts."],t.s)
B.aD0=s(["14. Miscellaneous","This Policy does not cover third-party sites linked to Reno Research.\nReno Research will not sell your personal information to third parties without your permission.\n\nThe website is not intended for children under 18, and Reno Research does not knowingly collect information from them."],t.s)
B.aAW=s(["15. Contacting the Data Protection Officer","You can request access to or correction of your Personal Data within thirty (30) days.\nYou can also send complaints or feedback to the Data Protection Officer (DPO) at hello@renoresearch.sg.\n\nTo opt out of the use of your Personal Data for specific purposes, email the DPO. This may affect our ability to serve you.\n\nYou can also contact us at +65 8088 0201"],t.s)
B.aAe=s([B.aBo,B.aBs,B.aB5,B.aCS,B.aD6,B.aC0,B.aAT,B.azU,B.aBl,B.aDe,B.aAN,B.aC8,B.aBi,B.aAh,B.aD0,B.aAW],t.rj)
B.aBX=s(["Cookie Policy",'Reno Research Pte. Ltd ("we," "us," or "our") uses cookies and similar tracking technologies on our website ("Software"). This Cookie Policy explains what cookies are, how we use them, and your choices regarding their use. By using our Software, you agree to the use of cookies as described in this policy.'],t.s)
B.aC1=s(["What Are Cookies?","Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device (computer, smartphone, or other devices) when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites work more efficiently and provide information to the owners of the site. Cookies can be 'persistent' or 'session' cookies. Persistent cookies remain on your device after you close your browser, while session cookies are deleted when you close your browser."],t.s)
B.aDs=s(["How We Use Cookies","We use cookies for a variety of reasons detailed below. Unfortunately, in most cases, there are no industry-standard options for disabling cookies without completely disabling the functionality and features they add to this Software. It is recommended that you leave on all cookies if you are not sure whether you need them or not, in case they are used to provide a service that you use."],t.s)
B.aBt=s(["Types of Cookies We Use",""],t.s)
B.aCJ=s(["Essential Cookies","These cookies are necessary for the proper functioning of the Software. They enable you to authenticate and navigate the Software and use its features. Without these cookies, most services cannot be provided."],t.s)
B.aCW=s(["Performance Cookies","These cookies collect information about how you use the Software, such as which pages you visit most often and if you receive error messages. The information collected is used to improve how the Software works."],t.s)
B.aB8=s(["Functional Cookies","These cookies allow the Software to remember choices you make (such as your username, language, or the region you are in) and provide enhanced, more personal features."],t.s)
B.aBC=s(["Third-Party Cookies","In some special cases, we also use cookies provided by trusted third parties."],t.s)
B.azn=s(["Google Analytics","We use Google Analytics to help us understand how you use the Software and ways that we can improve your experience. These cookies may track things such as how long you spend on the Software and the pages that you visit so we can continue to produce engaging content."],t.s)
B.aCE=s(["Your Choices Regarding Cookies","You have the right to choose whether or not to accept cookies. Here are some ways you can manage your cookie preferences:\n\nBrowser Settings: Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. You can set your browser to block or delete cookies. However, please note that disabling cookies may affect the functionality of the Software.\n\nOpt-Out Tools: Some third-party services provide tools to opt-out of data collection and targeted advertising."],t.s)
B.aAb=s(["Managing Cookies","To manage your cookie preferences, follow these steps for your browser:\n\nGoogle Chrome: Go to Settings > Privacy and security > Cookies and other site data.\nMozilla Firefox: Go to Options > Privacy & Security > Cookies and Site Data.\nMicrosoft Edge: Go to Settings > Site permissions > Cookies and site data.\nSafari: Go to Preferences > Privacy > Manage Website Data."],t.s)
B.aC9=s(["Changes to This Cookie Policy","We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices and services. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Cookie Policy on our website."],t.s)
B.aAj=s(["Contact Us","If you have any questions or concerns about this Cookie Policy, please contact us at hello@renoresearch.sg.\n\nReno Research Pte. Ltd.\nEmail: hello@renoresearch.sg\nEffective Date: 22 October 2025\nThis Cookie Policy was last updated on 22 October 2025."],t.s)
